1
00:00:01,030 --> 00:00:02,321
Per Weapon mode.

2
00:00:02,355 --> 00:00:04,829
Every weapon gets its own anti-recoil.

3
00:00:05,929 --> 00:00:08,749
Other modes pick a category, and switch between two

4
00:00:08,749 --> 00:00:09,792
profiles.

5
00:00:10,042 --> 00:00:12,023
Wrong category, wrong setting.

6
00:00:12,423 --> 00:00:15,261
In Per Weapon, every weapon has its own slot.

7
00:00:15,281 --> 00:00:17,171
No profile to confuse.

8
00:00:18,271 --> 00:00:21,458
You still need a DualSense, with adaptive triggers on.

9
00:00:21,708 --> 00:00:23,797
Hold L2, release Options.

10
00:00:23,817 --> 00:00:26,447
Go to Combat, Weapon Detect, and enable it.

11
00:00:26,697 --> 00:00:27,288
Press Cross.

12
00:00:27,288 --> 00:00:29,322
Device stays PS5.

13
00:00:29,342 --> 00:00:31,650
Press Down, and set Type to Per Weapon.

14
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,814
A new row appears: Teach Weapon.

15
00:00:33,834 --> 00:00:34,725
Leave with Circle.

16
00:00:34,725 --> 00:00:35,941
It saves itself.

17
00:00:37,041 --> 00:00:38,093
Fire once.

18
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:40,867
The weapon claims its own slot, automatically.

19
00:00:41,117 --> 00:00:43,357
Known weapons show their real name.

20
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:45,996
Unknown ones become Custom, plus a number.

21
00:00:47,096 --> 00:00:48,620
Too high or too low?

22
00:00:48,659 --> 00:00:51,356
Hold L2 and press Up or Down, while firing.

23
00:00:51,606 --> 00:00:53,988
It's permanent, for that exact weapon.

24
00:00:54,238 --> 00:00:57,359
Switch weapons, and the next one has its own values.

25
00:00:58,459 --> 00:01:01,705
Two weapons sharing a signature show a question mark.

26
00:01:01,725 --> 00:01:04,595
Press L2 and Right, to switch to the other one.

27
00:01:04,996 --> 00:01:06,004
Totally wrong?

28
00:01:06,024 --> 00:01:09,373
Hold L2, Circle and Down, to open your sixty-four slots,

29
00:01:09,373 --> 00:01:10,173
and pick.

30
00:01:11,273 --> 00:01:12,053
Weapon missing?

31
00:01:12,073 --> 00:01:12,930
Teach it.

32
00:01:12,950 --> 00:01:15,004
Open Teach Weapon, and pick a slot.

33
00:01:15,254 --> 00:01:16,475
Fire with the weapon.

34
00:01:16,495 --> 00:01:18,702
The screen shows the measured values.

35
00:01:18,722 --> 00:01:21,622
Fire two or three times: they should stay the same.

36
00:01:21,872 --> 00:01:24,105
Confirm with Cross, pick its category,

37
00:01:24,125 --> 00:01:25,617
then a name if you want.

38
00:01:25,867 --> 00:01:26,367
Saved.

39
00:01:26,379 --> 00:01:29,480
Slots even survive a power off, and a re-flash.

40
00:01:30,580 --> 00:01:33,020
To tweak a saved weapon, open its slot,

41
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:35,966
pick a row, and change the value with Left and Right.

42
00:01:36,216 --> 00:01:37,046
Square deletes it.

43
00:01:37,046 --> 00:01:38,332
It asks first.

44
00:01:39,432 --> 00:01:42,415
One anti-recoil switch covers all your weapons.

45
00:01:42,665 --> 00:01:45,315
Custom weapon badly tuned mid-fight?

46
00:01:45,335 --> 00:01:47,480
Hold Share and Triangle for a second,

47
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,646
to fall back to the manual profile.

48
00:01:50,746 --> 00:01:53,336
The full guide is on rocketmod.org.

49
00:01:53,736 --> 00:01:54,546
RocketMod.

50
00:01:54,546 --> 00:01:55,548
Per Weapon.
